    "counters": [],
    "adapt": "A hostless plot on the Saint-Philippe dock (p5, 14 x 32 m, flat ground beside the N-S road r17): a small fenced yard, 9 m wide and 27 m deep, gate gap on the south side. Container nine (the short one, `LF_ContainerNine_Everon1989.et`: key, stock and refill timer set on its prefab, crime B3 #4195) stands in the back row beside a second plain container, both lying north to south with an aisle between them. Marcel the tally clerk (the same row as `tally-clerk.json`, #4199) stands by the yellow tally hut just inside the gate, facing the gate, so the player meets him first. The kit never turns. Every row rests on the probed ground (`--terrain`). Rows are rigid: shift, never stretch."
